        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 Gaymei ricmei khang kawmei meic pumsin guang the,",
            "Rihmei rih ’dow khang e, nang dawlou ni cho?",
            "Chamdaanvna neihlaana katumcna ’daw tho;",
            "Chwn-nuhmei zaucgaymei swna gut lak cho?",
            "",
            "Jisu khang zaucgaypuimei!",
            "Gaymei ricmei!",
            "Meic nunc thu gutlou the, nang ’kumh cho?",
            "Rihpy kiu Jisu e, ping zat khang maek ge;",
            "Chwn-nuhmei zaucgaymei swna gut lak cho?",
            "",
            "2 Riphyan guay ta rihmei sw khang Jisu kaw the,",
            "Tingmik ’thuic, kaganv ’thuic Kakhang rih ’dow khang,",
            "Nang ta ’patlou lak ge, anaa tanv bam e;",
            "Chwn-nuhmei zaucgaymei swna gut lak cho?",
            "",
            "3 Nang ta zianpui zaeng ^&8 ’thukna kawpui tuang the,",
            "Kalungning baklou the, maansei zaat khang ^&8;",
            "’Taw na hei kaw bam the, Kakhwan nthanna;",
            "Chwn-nuhmei zaucgaymei swna gut lak cho?",
            "",
            "4 Rihdai hei luai lana rih hei ngampui nungc kiu,",
            "’Twnmei biangpiumei nunc guang kariu pwkhou,",
            "Hymdaihmei pyrun kiu kaniw run puni;",
            "Chwn-nuhmei zaucgaymei swna gut lak cho?"
          ]
        }
      },
